n*   **景深：** 使用了大光圈拍摄，创造了浅景深效果，背景虚化明显，主体与背景分离度高。\n*   **色彩：** 色彩搭配和谐，白衬衫、蓝领带和蓝裙子与粉色发尾形成清新明快的对比，整体色调偏向柔和的冷色调。\n\n---\n\n**总结提示词（可用于AI图像生成）：**\n\n> 一张充满青春活力的日系动漫风格写真，主角是一位年轻的二次元少女，拥有金粉渐变双马尾、蓝色大眼睛，身穿经典日式校服（白色短袖衬衫 + 深蓝色百褶裙），头戴白色毛绒猫耳发饰。她正对着镜头，双手轻扶猫耳，表情俏皮自信，略带傲娇。背景是虚化的户外公园草坪，自然柔和的光线，浅景深效果，整体画面清新甜美，充满少女感。\n\n---"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 75, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 24, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 21}, {"outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "MODEL"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": ["z_image_turbo_bf16.safetensors", "default"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "unet_name"}, "name": "unet_name", "label": "unet_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "unet_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "weight_dtype"}, "name": "weight_dtype", "label": "weight_dtype", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "weight_dtype"}], "flags": {}, "type": "UNETLoader", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [487.70343017578125, 82], "pos": [-693.064208984375, -353.7552795410156], "id": 68, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "UNETLoader"}, "order": 8}, {"outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "links": [7], "label": "LATENT", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "LATENT"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": [960239536460755, "randomize", 9, 1, "res_multistep", "simple", 1], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 81, "label": "model", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "model"}, {"name": "positive", "link": 3, "label": "positive", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "positive"}, {"name": "negative", "link": 5, "label": "negative", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "negative"}, {"name": "latent_image", "link": 30, "label": "latent_image", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "latent_image"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "